# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — OHOS/musl 下 CMake 动态插件系统须 SHARED + 显式链接依赖 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-06
# Software: corrade 2020.06(任何含动态插件系统的 CMake C++ 库,如 corrade PluginManager)
# Gate: conan create / 本地交叉编译 (build/link)
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id:                     E1885
title: OHOS(musl 加载器)下 CMake 动态插件必须构建为 SHARED 并显式链接依赖,否则 dlopen 时符号无法解析
trigger_tool: clang|ld.lld|cmake
phase: linking|runtime
error_signature: Error relocating .*\.so: .*symbol not found|undefined symbol: .*referenced by|Target ".*" of type MODULE_LIBRARY may not be linked
severity:               2
category:               platform, cmake, toolchain, linking
match_keywords: OHOS, musl, dlopen, symbol not found, MODULE, SHARED, plugin, NEEDED,
  no-undefined, allow-shlib-undefined, -z undefs, PluginManager, Corrade
root_cause: OHOS 动态链接器为 musl,dlopen() 默认 BIND_NOW;corrade 2020.06 在非 Windows
  平台用 add_library(MODULE) 构建插件且不链接依赖,依赖 glibc 的"全局作用域"在运行时
  解析主程序符号。musl 下插件 .so 的 DT_NEEDED 只有 libc/libc++,dlopen 时
  AbstractPlugin 等符号解析失败(Error relocating ... symbol not found)。
  同时 OHOS 工具链在 OHOS_COMMON_LINKER_FLAGS 注入 -Wl,--no-undefined,链接期就拦截。
  而 CMake 又禁止 MODULE 链接 MODULE(PitBull→Dog 插件间依赖),必须 SHARED。
affected_scope: 所有在 HarmonyOS/OHOS(aarch64, musl)上构建的含动态加载插件系统的
  CMake C++ 库;glibc Linux 无此问题(全局符号作用域 + 默认允许未定义符号)
verification_cmd: |
  # 插件 .so 必须含依赖库 NEEDED
  llvm-readelf -d <plugin>.so | grep NEEDED   # 应列出 CorradePluginManager 等
  # 链接期验证: 无 --no-undefined 拦截
  cmake -DCMAKE_MODULE_LINKER_FLAGS="-Wl,-z,undefs" ...
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: plugin-shared-explicit-link
rec_description: OHOS 下将 corrade_add_plugin 改为 SHARED 并显式链接插件依赖 + -Wl,-z,undefs
rec_command: cmake -B build -DCMAKE_SHARED_LINKER_FLAGS="-Wl,-z,undefs" -DCMAKE_MODULE_LINKER_FLAGS="-Wl,-z,undefs" ...
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: 以 patches/ 补丁修改 modules/UseCorrade.cmake 与各测试 CMakeLists,
  conandata.yml 登记 patch_type=portability
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: no-dynamic-plugins
fallback_description: 若插件必须保持 MODULE,则按 Android 模式禁用动态插件
  (CORRADE_PLUGINMANAGER_NO_DYNAMIC_PLUGIN_SUPPORT),仅用静态插件
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: 不推荐(减少动态加载测试覆盖)
prerequisite_of:
conflicts_with:
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-corrade-2020.06-ohos-cmake-plugin-shared-linking.md
last_updated:               2026-10-17
authors:               unknown
